\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"nl-article-banner\" style=\"font-size: 0; padding: 0; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 600px;\"><a href=\"https://trk.wsj.com/click/47473391.15466/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud3NqLmNvbS9uZXdzbGV0dGVycy93c2otZWNvbm9taWNzP21vZD1kamVtZWNvbiZmb2xsb3dDZW50ZXJVcmw9aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud3NqLmNvbS9wcmVmZXJlbmNlLWNlbnRlci9uZXdzbGV0dGVycyZuZXdzbGV0dGVySWQ9JTIyMTUyJTIy/64d399fc856ebc3ad955d720B82da8671\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0274b6;\"><img alt=\"WSJ Economics\" src=\"https://s.wsj.net/newsletter/article-banners/Sailthru_600x120_Economics_Web.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 0; display: block; outline: 0; text-decoration: none; height: auto; width: 100%; font-size: 13px;\" width=\"600\" height=\"auto\" /></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"nl-global-spacer20 nl-global-divider040\" style=\"font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"global-spacer20\" style=\"height: 20px; line-height: 20px; font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\" height=\"20\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"masthead-bottom-divider\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid; border-color: #222; font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"global-spacer24\" style=\"height: 24px; line-height: 24px; font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\" height=\"24\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"nl-global-spacer24\" style=\"font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"padding: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; font-stretch: normal;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; margin: 0px 0px 24px;\">Hi,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; margin: 0px 0px 24px;\">I&rsquo;m Greg Ip. You might remember me from WSJ&rsquo;s Real Time Economics newsletter. I also write the weekly <a href=\"https://trk.wsj.com/click/47473391.15466/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud3NqLmNvbS9uZXdzL3R5cGVzL2NhcGl0YWwtYWNjb3VudD9mb2xsb3dDZW50ZXJVcmw9aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud3NqLmNvbS9wcmVmZXJlbmNlLWNlbnRlci9uZXdzbGV0dGVycyZuZXdzbGV0dGVySWQ9JTIyMTUyJTIy/64d399fc856ebc3ad955d720B0d484624\">Capital Account</a> column, which gives you fresh insight into the most fascinating trends in U.S. and global economics.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Starting next week, I&rsquo;ll be sending you our new and improved WSJ Economics newsletter. Every Tuesday and Thursday, the newsletter will feature my take on a critical issue in finance or economics. I&rsquo;ll draw on my decades of experience as well as the vast reporting resources and expertise of the WSJ economics team. Can you imagine a more vital time? Every day brings a new twist in the world, whether rising global interest rates, another phase of trade war, a challenge from China or an AI breakthrough that could transform work and business.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">I&rsquo;ll also give you quick summaries of the most interesting news, social media, Substacks and academia, plus highlights of the big upcoming events in economics. I know your time is precious, so I promise to be concise. You&rsquo;ll be done in less than five minutes.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Thanks, and I look forward to staying in touch. Don&rsquo;t hesitate to reach out by replying to this email or writing to me at <a href=\"mailto:wsjeconomics@wsj.com\">wsjeconomics@wsj.com</a>.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&mdash;Greg Ip</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><i>P.S. Subscriptions make our journalism possible. WSJ Economics readers can enjoy a <a href=\"https://trk.wsj.com/click/47473391.\">special rate on a new subscription</a>. If you&rsquo;re already a WSJ subscriber, thank you for your support.</i></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"nl-global-spacer24\" style=\"font-size: 0; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div style=\"height: 0; line-height: 0;\"> </div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://trk.wsj.com/img/64d399fc856ebc3ad955d720s9ipb.bxm/ed065731.gi